1-22T04:46:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558418/miami-tops-virginia-tech-face-wake-forest-acc-title-game","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079342/sammy-brown","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sammy_Brown_(linebacker,_born_2005)"},"pick":{"pick":45,"round":2,"team":"BAL","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Sammy Brown (linebacker, born 2005)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sammy_Brown_(linebacker,_born_2005)","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-22T04:17:10Z","intro":"Sammy Brown (born September 29, 2005) is an American college football linebacker for the Clemson Tigers.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Brown was originally rated a four-star recruit by most recruiting services but was later rerated as a five-star prospect. Several outlets have ranked him as the best inside linebacker in the 2024 class. Brown committed to play college football at Clemson over offers from Georgia, Ohio State, Tennessee, and Oklahoma."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Brown joined the Clemson Tigers as an early enrollee in January 2024."}]}}